   "source": [
    "`plot_actual_vs_fitted(est, level=True)` draws it; the estimation report\n",
    "(`mcon.report()`) has this plot next to the one for `DLOG(CON)`.\n",
    "`mcon.actual_fitted()` puts `af_level_df` of all estimated equations in one\n",
    "dataframe."
   ]
  },
  {
