  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "eec7c3f3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "With the `fit` option the model also gets the equation `CON_FITTED`, which\n",
    "gives the fitted value for any period. `solver='res_ng'` evaluates each\n",
    "equation once on the data:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "bcf334d6",
