   "source": [
    "mfit = mcon.mmodel\n",
    "res = mfit(mfit.insertModelVar(npl), 2012, 2024, solver='res_ng', silent=1)\n",
    "pd.DataFrame({'Actual': npl.loc[2016:2024, 'CON'],\n",
    "              'CON_FITTED': res.loc[2016:2024, 'CON_FITTED']}).round(0)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "98bf6b3d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "(other)=\n",
    "## Other changes\n",
    "\n",
    "**ModelFlow in the browser and the cloud**\n",
    "- ModelFlow runs in JupyterLite (Pyodide). numba, graphviz, dash and pyarrow\n",
    "  are not needed there; pip leaves them out by itself.\n",
    "- A GitHub Codespace with ModelFlow installed.\n",
    "\n",
    "There are many smaller changes as well: checks and t-values in estimation,\n",
    "clearer error messages, pandas 3 support, regular expressions in variable\n",
    "patterns, GAMS and Gekko onboarding and a number of fixes. They are listed in\n",
    "[All changes since the book](changes_since_book.md)."
   ]
  }
 ],
